review_content = "I smell cash brewing! 

I don’t often frequent such… paltry establishments, but after hearing about Boogle’s latest acquisition, I couldn’t help checking it out! What a marvelous overturn this has been! 

I may need to add this “Tippy” character as an investment to my business portfolio. Not that I need any more money (though you can never have enough!) 
